# Meteor packages used by this project, one per line.
# Check this file (and the other files in this directory) into your repository.
#
# 'meteor add' and 'meteor remove' will edit this file for you,
# but you can also edit it by hand.
#
# NOTE: the direct packages that used to be unversioned are pinned EXACT (@=,
# matching .meteor/versions). Leaving them unversioned let Meteor's constraint
# solver reconsider every newer catalog version on each build; on Windows CI the
# NTFS enumeration order tipped that search into a pathological, CPU-bound,
# non-terminating case in prepareProjectForBuild (mac/Linux resolved the same
# inputs in seconds). Exact pins leave the solver a single candidate. Bump these
# deliberately, in step with .meteor/versions.

